    dcterms:source "Book of the Dead, chapter 125, the address to the forty-two gods, address 35, Papyrus of Ani, in the transliteration and English of E. A. Wallis Budge, London: British Museum, 1895, plates XXXI-XXXII, pp. 198-203",
        "Budge, A Hieroglyphic Vocabulary to the Theban Recension of the Book of the Dead, London: Kegan Paul, 1911, s.v. Ari-em-ab-f, p. 52" ;
