    dcterms:source "Book of the Dead, chapter 125, the address to the forty-two gods, address 42, Papyrus of Ani, in the transliteration and English of E. A. Wallis Budge, London: British Museum, 1895, plates XXXI-XXXII, pp. 198-203",
