        "Budge, A Hieroglyphic Vocabulary to the Theban Recension of the Book of the Dead, London: Kegan Paul, 1911, s.v. Kenemti, p. 410" ;
    skos:altLabel "Kenemti (Vocabulary, 1911)"@en ;
