        "Budge, A Hieroglyphic Vocabulary to the Theban Recension of the Book of the Dead, London: Kegan Paul, 1911, s.v. Khemi, p. 303" ;
    skos:altLabel "Khemi (Vocabulary, 1911)"@en ;
    skos:definition "The twenty-fourth address of chapter 125 in the Papyrus of Ani. Budge carries the name over untranslated. The god is addressed as coming forth from Kesiu, and the address is bound to one denial: I have not committed offence."@en ;
    pm:attestedBy pm:textualAttestation ;
    pm:fromWork pmw:BookOfTheDead ;
